# Tiba .gitignore
# Tiba holds protected health information (PHI). Nothing that contains a secret, a patient's
# details or a copy of the database may ever be committed: once pushed, it stays in git history
# even after it's deleted. Real secrets live in .env.local here and in the host's environment
# settings (Render) in production.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
# Every env file (.env, .env.local, .env.production…), except the empty template.
.env*
!.env.example
# Keys, certificates and credential files.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.ppk
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.secret
*.secrets
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*-credentials.json
# Local tool settings that can hold tokens or personal permissions.
.npmrc
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- patient data (PHI)
# The local PGlite database, the email outbox (.data/outbox/*.eml) and anything else in .data.
/.data/
# Database copies and dumps. (Migrations in drizzle/*.sql are code and stay tracked.)
tiba-db-backup-*/
*.dump
*.backup
*.bak
*.sql.gz
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
# Saved emails and documents that may carry patient details: notes, invoices, agreements,
# contracts, IDs, uploads. Add a real document on purpose with `git add -f` if it is safe.
*.eml
*.pdf
*.doc
*.docx
*.xls
*.xlsx
# Spreadsheets of exported data; reference data in data/ stays tracked.
*.csv
!/data/*.csv
# Folders for anything private, exported or temporary.
/private/
/exports/
/uploads/
/tmp/
ds-upload-tmp/
ds-publish-tmp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- build output
/.next/
/out/
/build
/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- logs (they can echo requests)
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- hosting
.vercel
.render/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- operating system and editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# The Vercel CLI's link to the project (team and project IDs).
.vercel
